> Using Details

```catala-metadata
#[test]
#[testcase.testui]
#[testcase.test_description = ""]
#[testcase.test_title = "Fields out of declaration order"]
declaration scope Record_unordered:
  output calc scope Details.Record
```

```catala
scope Record_unordered:
  definition calc.detail equals Details.Detail {
    -- stamp: |2026-01-01|
    -- rank: 3
    -- fee: $12.00
  }
  assertion (calc.total = $12.00)
```
